==Notes==
This quest is repeatable daily.
==Requirements==
This quest is only available during the annual [[Birthday Bash]] event.
==To Start==
Speak with [[Camellia]] located in [[Sanctuary]].
==Goals==
Camellia, the royal party planner, wants you to grab a cupcake.
*Grab a cupcake
*Return to Camellia
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Camellia]] located in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Hey, <Player Name>! Did you <font color='#D9781A'>grab</font> a <font color='#D9781A'>cupcake</font> today?<br />No? Well, you should!" -Camellia
#Grab a cupcake
#*Select the floating tray of cupcakes near [[Camellia]].
#Speak with [[Camellia]] located in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Oh, you ate the last cupcake? I hope it tasted delicious!<br />It looks like we'll need to pick up another order of cakes." -Camellia
